        <h1 itemprop="name">Economic Outlook</h1>

            <div class="intro-author">

<div class="author-img">

                        <img src=/-/media/FRBP/Assets/Images/People/Executive-Leadership/25-06_Anna-Paulson.jpg alt="Anna Paulson" />
                    </div>

                <div class="author-desc">
                    <p class="author-by">by</p>
                        <a href=/our-people/anna-paulson class="author-name" itemprop="author">Anna Paulson</a>
                    <p class="author-title">President and Chief Executive Officer</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        <p class="article-date-published" itemprop="datePublished">13 Oct ’25</p>

        <p class="intro-excerpt" itemprop="description">Philadelphia Fed President Anna Paulson gives her first economic outlook speech at the National Association for Business Economics Annual Meeting in Philadelphia.</p>

        <div class="article-intro-footer">

            <div>


